Protocol references
-------------------
The implementation was independently written from observed protocol behavior and public
references. KX-Bridge is used only as a protocol reference; no substantial source blocks are
copied from it. Keep its license terms separate from this project and do not copy source from
unlicensed/unclear third-party repositories into this tree.
